            "source:39d980a0b4d1163c054c03f1"
          ],
          "text": "Magtheridon is a mighty demon held by sorcery deep within Hellfire Citadel, where A'dal's trials direct champions to confront him. He resents those who take his blood and vows to crush Illidan and reclaim Outland; his taunts show contempt for intruders and confidence that his bindings will fail.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 17257
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
    {
