      "text": "You are in Magtheridon's Lair, a chamber deep within Hellfire Citadel in Hellfire Peninsula. Magtheridon, a mighty demon, is held here by sorcery. He resents those who take his blood and vows to crush Illidan and reclaim Outland. Hellfire Warders and Hellfire Channelers fill the place.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 3836
      }
